1
00:00:03,641 --> 00:00:11,381
Start with Architecture. One unit is
30 cm, so our floor is 90 by 50 units.

2
00:00:11,431 --> 00:00:20,758
Choose Rectangular Slab, and snap
out the 27 by 15 metre footprint.

3
00:00:20,808 --> 00:00:35,678
Wall draws the perimeter as a chain. Enter finishes it.

4
00:00:40,243 --> 00:00:57,993
Nice. Two cross walls mark the north and
south sides of a single central lobby.

5
00:00:59,208 --> 00:01:14,558
Leave side passages in the lobby walls.
All four office zones lead to this node.

6
00:01:39,864 --> 00:01:46,565
Door openings need helpers. Press
T on the wall base at each jamb.

7
00:01:46,615 --> 00:02:01,725
Add Hole: pick the top of one helper,
then the opposite base on the wall.

8
00:02:44,076 --> 00:02:53,861
Good. Door fits the first opening.
These are 1.8 metres wide and 2.1 high.

9
00:02:53,911 --> 00:03:06,048
Select the door, then Move Copy between
matching corners of the next opening.

10
00:03:06,098 --> 00:03:20,044
Repeat for the entrance. Copy the component
instead of drawing each door again.

11
00:03:20,094 --> 00:03:30,746
For repeatable office bays, draw one short
partition, leaving a shared access strip.

12
00:03:30,796 --> 00:03:42,775
Move Copy repeats the partition
nine metres along the floor grid.

13
00:03:42,825 --> 00:03:53,694
Cool. Copy both partitions to the south
office zone, using the same grid spacing.

14
00:03:53,744 --> 00:04:09,014
Now a ceiling module. Zoom in and draw
a 60 centimetre square on the floor.

15
00:04:16,647 --> 00:04:32,237
Press T at its corner. Move the panel up
the helper to the 2.7 metre wall height.

16
00:04:33,807 --> 00:04:48,517
Nice. A helper at ceiling level gives
the horizontal pitch for Move Copy.

17
00:04:48,679 --> 00:04:58,052
For a long repeat, type 2 x39:
thirty-nine more panels, two units apart.

18
00:04:58,102 --> 00:05:04,162
We leave the ceiling partial so the
office layout stays visible below it.

19
00:05:04,212 --> 00:05:15,412
One central lobby, repeated partitions
and doors, and a reusable ceiling module.
